enue generated"},{"text":"Return on intervention"}]}]},{"heading":"Higher Education — India","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Possible postgraduate routes:"},{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des → M.Des"},{"type":"p","text":"Specialisations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strategic Design"},{"text":"Social Design"},{"text":"Sustainable Design"},{"text":"Service Design"},{"text":"Design Management"},{"text":"Interaction Design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des → MBA"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful specialisations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainability"},{"text":"Social Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Strategy"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Business Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Development"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des → Master's in Development Studies / Public Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Development Studies"},{"text":"Public Policy"},{"text":"International Development"},{"text":"Social Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Sustainability"}]}]},{"heading":"International Education","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Possible postgraduate directions:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Social Innovation"},{"text":"Sustainable Development"},{"text":"Sustainability Management"},{"text":"Design for Social Innovation"},{"text":"Public Policy"},{"text":"International Development"},{"text":"Social Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Environmental Management"},{"text":"Impact Measurement"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"United Kingdom"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Sweden"},{"text":"Denmark"},{"text":"France"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"United States"},{"text":"Australia"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For this pathway, research experience + field exposure + measurable project outcomes can be more valuable than a portfolio focused only on aesthetics."}]},{"heading":"AI & Emerging Technology","kind":